{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60bc3f5c46908171bf402d50602280e1ec8df07618911b10301bd15becf8030d", "ja": "（静香と千早の新曲披露公演は、大反響のうちに幕を\n閉じた。早くもリバイバルを望む声が届いている……）", "zh": "（静香和千早的新曲演出在巨大的反响中落下了帷幕。已经有不少声音传来，希望能再次举办……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec15f9e44917e547b356ff25853fa39e157a13cabef1b263c294242a7a0359f1", "ja": "失礼します、{$P$}！\n今、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "打扰了，{$P$}！\n现在方便占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1002_p", "source_sha256": "33cfe3b0dee241ef21eff3952fe86f79a69b33e206aa425fce1d5f5bc120f7d9", "ja": "静香か。いいけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "是静香啊。可以进来，不过怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "e7eda0061964c36d31c5ea9249adf33544eab064a59b93a9aae90dc51ac083cf", "ja": "大事な話があるんです！\nこれからの、私のプロデュース方針、っていうか。", "zh": "我有重要的事情要说！\n也就是关于……今后对我的制作方针。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f2deaaaf00054e6e360bd2bd7a869f8df997cd3393daf4b4ee93ec63c425bbb7", "ja": "えっ。確かに大事な話だな……。\nわかった、聞くよ。何かやりたいことがあるのか？", "zh": "诶。确实是很重要的事啊……\n知道了，我听着。你有什么想做的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "face6f6b7f9e3c57d6901cc3758b14fee6c655da6dca3f120f9d44eb32666ebd", "ja": "はい。あの……私のレッスン、\nもっと増やしてもらえませんか？", "zh": "是的。那个……能不能再给我增加一些课程？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1006_p", "source_sha256": "54201294cbf112b08c26632359fc4f5a73e269ff03cf6097ebca170afdd5be10", "ja": "……え？　レッスンは、今でも十分すぎると思う\nけど……。しかも公演が終わったばかりだぞ？", "zh": "……咦？我觉得现在的课程，\n就已经完全够多了……更何况公演才刚结束吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "207ee8e2b9b262772310dd9e720f30db3c9ab7d72632427927a7d85f9febab1d", "ja": "だからこそ、です！\n今回の公演で、思い知りました。", "zh": "正因为如此！\n我在这次公演中，深切体会到了这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "04165601e267b0c419ec0a53cbcab89d4fc41e238e06c7a22a0e6f1107bfd507", "ja": "私、やっぱりまだまだだって。歌もですけど、\nなにより、アイドルとしての姿勢っていうか……。", "zh": "我果然还差得远呢。唱歌方面自不必说，更重要的是，作为偶像的那种态度，或者说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "4fb61f258f895c9692288cc8dddb1ba706d3551c0dffd84cd22e4600c7d2cb8a", "ja": "なんて言うのかな。懐の深さ……余裕……。\nうう、とにかく足りないんです！", "zh": "该怎么说呢。胸襟的宽广……从容……\n唔，总之就是还远远不够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b7112da4d7aeea4051303e941aac572a05276f747f9bbf8d16137e29190c2a84", "ja": "うーん……。まあ、何かあるとしたら\n経験の差、みたいなものかな？", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢。要真说有什么不同，大概就是经验上的差距吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "c6376d8da482befaecda9a00fb9ee035971b5c6d850215fc389872488fba6d33", "ja": "あっ、そうかも！　たまにはいいことも\n言うんですね、{$P$}！", "zh": "啊，说不定真是这样！{$P$}先生偶尔也会说些有道理的话呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "bdfbc8b396eb1ee50b609b006dbc74e3ed417b3c40f64e3d6c2b4e79a1b3d6ac", "ja": "だから、せめてレッスンくらい増やさないと。\nいつまでたっても追いつけません。お願いします！", "zh": "所以，至少也得增加一些训练才行。\n这样下去永远都追不上。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1013_p", "source_sha256": "79bf7dc879a472cd74f64bbf8729618c92517b09bb04675f0401e4f02ea4409b", "ja": "なるほど……。\nわかった、そういうことなら……却下！", "zh": "原来如此……。\n明白了，既然是这样……驳回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "0922d7492172b1d4c5fb68ba2f1d0607e49926325127198afed290eea5c85385", "ja": "きゃ……ええっ！？　ど、どうしてですか！？\nひどい、ひどすぎます！　最低！", "zh": "呀……诶！？为、为什么啊！？\n太过分了，太过分了！差劲透顶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b022822722e12295010def0a567d66725d62dbc09f3e1ebec73c75ac2bf9acc7", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……。\n本当は、静香もわかってるんじゃないか？", "zh": "不是，我不是那个意思……\n其实，静香心里也很清楚吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6e788f87ce89814875bb9157caae0eb1fbbe33e36fb38dc48f5213b20503bf7d", "ja": "違いが経験の差だとしたら、\nそれは多分、レッスンだけじゃ埋まらない、って。", "zh": "如果差别在于经验，那么这恐怕不是光靠练习就能弥补的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "d7367a4a00a2c3ee499d031ab0e61b3c9a01c793ddade1b58cdcef1732cabe03", "ja": "そ、それは、そうですけど……。\nでも、やらないよりはマシだと思いますっ。", "zh": "这、这倒是没错……  \n不过，我觉得总比什么都不做要好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1018_p", "source_sha256": "0c2164f035a08bbe546b612b872ab74220efe51a5f347cb815a565f77b00a61c", "ja": "どうかな。レッスンをした分、他のことができないし。\n他が見えなくなったりもするだろ？", "zh": "你觉得呢。练习花了时间，就没法做其他事情了。\n也会变得看不到其他东西，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ca5a9ea287b04443936f8841d463dc71f132df305aa1a2b8900a880a7bfedf59", "ja": "歌以外のいろんな経験があって、今の千早がいるんだ。\n静香もレッスン以外の、いろんな経験をしないと。", "zh": "正是有了唱歌以外的各种经历，才成就了现在的千早。\n静香也必须经历一些排练以外的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "388de58eb67aed024a459f7a51af7ca83cec12411fa52a1389b08670bb9778f0", "ja": "そ、そうですか……。確かに、そういうの……\n必要だと思います。わかりました……。", "zh": "是、是这样啊……确实，那种经历……\n我觉得很有必要。明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1021_015siz", "source_sha256": "a2b6e03a1839a75eebeb74a9898f3cd9ab30e25d3e21d2939e8f59cdd09cf993", "ja": "そういえば、{$P$}はいろんな\n仕事を取って来ますよね。あれも、そういう……。", "zh": "说起来，{$P$}总是会带来各种各样的工作呢。那些也是，类似那种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "a848491496effd0545758b079d8fd25a72bdc7fd2dbff9673b3f2dcfdb8ef8bb", "ja": "……あ。", "zh": "……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "655d0b0021f9d9020bb412a82ebe3a4c26f5493c1ec3ce56fecca6869ca5566d", "ja": "もしかして……私も、ネコ耳に水着とか……\nそういうの……えっ、そうなのかな……？", "zh": "难道说……我也要戴猫耳、穿泳装之类的……\n这种……欸，难道真的是这样吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0183_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0183_1024_p", "source_sha256": "102e614a1905fdf93be854b5ce548d7f7ab0888ba78878a027f44ff57c846900", "ja": "（多分それはあまり関係ないが……\nまったくないとも言い切れない。頑張ろう、静香！）", "zh": "（我想那大概没什么关系……不过，也不能说完全没关系。加油，静香！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
